{"kind":"stack","id":"s-nutrition","title":"Animals and nutrition: what we eat and why","theme":{"background":"#f4f9f1","foreground":"#1f3a1f","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Nutrition"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"The food and drink an animal needs to grow, move and stay healthy."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"apple"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"Which of these gives an animal the nutrition it needs?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"Eating food","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Sitting in the sun all day","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"Drinking only air","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Can animals make their own food like plants do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"No, they must eat","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Yes, using sunlight","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Yes, using soil","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-t","content":"Balanced diet"},{"type":"text","id":"c4-e","content":"Eating the right types and amounts of food so the body gets all the nutrition it needs."},{"type":"button","id":"c4-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"Which animal gets its nutrition from eating other animals?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"A lion","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"A rabbit","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"A cow","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"You are out for a walk and get very hungry. Do you eat a healthy snack or skip lunch?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"Eat a healthy snack","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Skip lunch","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"Your body gets the nutrition it needs and you have energy to play. Well done!"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"Your body has no fuel, so you feel tired and cannot concentrate well."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Why do animals, including humans, need to eat?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"To get nutrition they cannot make themselves","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"To make their own sunlight","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"To keep their colour bright","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-h","content":"You finished the nutrition lesson!"},{"type":"text","id":"c10-m","content":"Animals cannot make their own food, so they must eat the right food every day to stay healthy and strong."}],"actions":[]}}
